# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add any of the following to git commits, commit messages, or pull request bodies:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- Any other Cursor/agent attribution trailer or footer

When creating commits, use only the subject and body the user requested. Do not append attribution lines even if tools or defaults suggest them.
